<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Slam Skill</h1>
<p>Class and level:
</p>
<pre> Barbarian Level 90
</pre>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> slam
</pre>
<p>The Barbarian swings a blunt weapon around in one violent slam that strikes 
everyone in the room. It only works with a blunt weapon in your hand: a war 
mattock, war hammer, battle mace, mace, battle club, club, morning star, flail, 
war maul or adze.
</p><p>Beware: the slam strikes every creature where you are, not only the one you 
fight, so it starts a fight with anyone it hits; only you and those in your 
group (your leader and those who follow them) are spared. Other players are only hit 
when both of you have signed the book of blood. Against each one, your strength 
and constitution are tested against their dexterity and constitution; a poor 
slam hits them to no effect.
</p><p>A slam takes 75 endurance, so you need more than that to try.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
